From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000004 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 23:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dashboard: install signed RAUC bundles

Replace the source-tree updater UI and API with bounded bundle staging,
signature verification, asynchronous RAUC installation, and status polling.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Yocto appliance update policy]
